\cf1\fs28\b Before the files are copied\b0\fs22\cf0\par
\par
\b Student Management System v1.18.82\b0\par
\par
This page is the same for both editions. Read the part about the edition you chose on the page "Installation Type".\par
\par
\b Docker Production Edition\b0\par
\bullet  Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit)\par
\bullet  Docker Desktop, installed and running\par
\bullet  4 GB RAM minimum (8 GB recommended)\par
\bullet  2 GB free disk space\par
\bullet  After the files are copied, the wizard builds the application's Docker image. The first time this takes 5-10 minutes.\par
\par
\b Native Lite Edition\b0\par
\bullet  Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit)\par
\bullet  Docker is not needed, and nothing is built\par
\par
\b What is installed\b0\par
\bullet  The application's files, normally in C:\\Program Files\\SMS\par
\bullet  Start Menu entries, and a desktop shortcut if that box is ticked\par
\par
Click Next to continue.\par
